<li>
<p>Geohash of the Google headquarter (length =3D 6):</p>
<pre><code>1001 10110 01001 10000 11011 11010 (base32 in binary) =E2=86=92 =
9q9hvu (base32)
</code></pre>
</li>
<li>
<p>Geohash of the Facebook headquarter (length =3D 6):</p>
<pre><code>1001 10110 01001 10001 10000 10111 (base32 in binary) =E2=86=92 =
9q9jhr (base32)
</code></pre>
</li>
</ul>
