<p>S2 is a complicated library and you are not expected to explain its inte=
rnals during an interview. But because it=E2=80=99s widely used in companie=
s such as Google, Tinder, etc., we will briefly cover its advantages.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>S2 is great for geofencing because it can cover arbitrary areas with var=
ying levels (Figure 17). According to Wikipedia, =E2=80=9CA geofence is a v=
irtual perimeter for a real-world geographic area. A geo-fence could be dyn=
amically generated=E2=80=94as in a radius around a point location, or a geo=
-fence can be a predefined set of boundaries (such as school zones or neigh=
borhood boundaries)=E2=80=9D [25].</p>
